  "readme": "# P29 node27: restore missing Subaru character\n\nScene10040052/node27 has the same native dialogue panel in two preserved original full frames at320/320.35 seconds. Two independent reviewers identify complete short sleeves and exclude the torn sleeveless tshirt02 variant using retained original-model full controls. Bind only character=live2d/AC_subaru_tshirt01. Neighbor26→27→28 panels and explicit existing transitions agree. Original/current model3,MOC and textures match.\n\nThe315 stable-key timestamp is an old OCR anchor, not a measured entry time. Complete native-FPS entry evidence for this node is not available. Historical raw embedded-control archives are absent and are not claimed fresh verified; retained control pictures, provenance and original model payloads support only static identity. Do not accept motion/face, precise timing, continuous saved playback or a whole scene from this change.\n\nAll13 fields, full native rows/IDs/branches/order, reviewed sidecars, manifest and ownership were checked.281 other formal guards and22 protected files remain unchanged. P29batches3–7 and P30first15 accepted characters were already installed; their36 identities were reconciled rather than installed again. Only compact metadata is archived.\n"
